          "name": "Story",
          "version": "1.0.0",
          "description": "A story in cards: its premise, its characters and places, the scenes in order and the threads that run through them. Its views are derived from the cards, so the story is readable as an outline without opening it.",
          "updatedAt": "2026-11-08T01:27:25.707Z"
